    "None": {
      "comment": "Auto Tiling highlight style: no highlight\nBreak timer background: a plain dark screen\nDetail row value: the script takes no argument\nImage Resizer: no TIFF compression\nLayout editor: no quick-apply key\nNo desktop picture chosen\nNo file chosen\nNo menu bar icons in this section\nNo shortcut chosen\nPowerRename text format: no case change\nRequired modifier key: no key needs to be held\nScreen Ruler default mode: no tool selected\nSunrise or sunset offset of zero minutes\nWi-Fi QR code: an open network has no password",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
